  CL8NK Entry: self-reading_fixed_point
  Self-reading fixed point - The numeral is its own decomposition: reading it and factoring it are the same act, as in
  a quine whose source is its output. The fixed point lives in the closure of Y on a pairing that is simultaneously
  multiplicative, a self-referential object
  Reference: CLINK L8 (Organism) — ⟨𐑦⋅𐑸⋅𐑾⋅𐑹⋅𐑐⋅𐑧⋅𐑲⋅𐑵⋅⊙⋅𐑫⋅𐑳⋅𐑟⟩ (from catalog)
